# Domain Architecture

## Layering (no zustand)

```
features/*  →  shared/{missions,events,trading}/use*.ts  →  lib/api/*.ts  →  supabase RPC
features/*  →  lib/{missions,events,trading}/*.ts (pure + zod only)
```

## Supabase domains (phonara-gb)

| Domain | Tables | RPCs |
|--------|--------|------|
| Missions | mission_templates, user_missions | list_user_missions, record_mission_progress, claim_mission_reward |
| Events | events, event_participants, event_leaderboard | list_events, join_event, get_event_leaderboard |
| Trading | markets, market_candles, trading_orders, trading_positions | fetch_market_candles, place_market_order, list_user_positions |
| Games audit | game_rounds | log_game_round |

## Money

- PHON missions/games: wallet_balances via RPC only
- USDT trading: place_market_order RPC only — no client balance mutation
- Demo/unauth: mocks/ display fallback — NOT money issuance

## Validation

- Zod schemas in `lib/{domain}/schemas.ts`
- Parse all RPC responses in `lib/api/*.ts`

## Lovable

- UI in `features/` only
- Never edit supabase/, types.ts, lib/api/ directly
